      "body_plain": "The New York Times has just published  a nice little article on R\n\n<http://www.nytimes.com/2009/01/07/technology/business-computing/\n07program.html?_r=1&pagewanted=all>\n\nwhich was then also discussed on the R-Help list\n\n<http://www.nabble.com/forum/Search.jtp?query=message%3AR+message%3ANew\n+york+times&daterange=2&startdate=1230833397964&enddate=1231438197964>\n\nIn particular, note how R  is doing in comparison with other software\nby pasting this into your console:\n\n####### CUT HERE #######\ntt3 <- structure(c(15, 458, 330, 219, 472, 517, 546, 511, 658, 681,\n712, 751, 763, 975, 703, 805, 752, 666, 548, 734, 963, 792, 945, 1002,\n775, 969, 745, 691, 773, 765, 853, 1024, 805, 1052, 1163, 999, 1184,\n1053, 1176, 1197, 911, 844, 1007, 1150, 1108, 1315, 1212, 1127, 1074,\n692, 947, 900, 853, 677, 894, 1068, 945, 784, 448, 813, 896, 823, 894,\n1129, 733, 492, 514, 493, 659, 1077, 778, 540, 476, 612, 1351, 1708,\n1720, 1595, 1720, 1519, 1177, 1163, 1963, 1615, 1572, 1696, 1491,\n1669, 1490, 1298, 1826, 1537, 1915, 1467, 1735, 1905, 2027, 1976,\n1439, 1592, 1636, 1424, 1941, 1845, 2010, 2199, 2373, 2133, 2445,\n1492, 1864, 2133, 1663, 1520, 1832, 1846, 1755, 1757, 1863, 1701,\n1926, 1689, 1646, 1832, 1545, 1445, 1636, 1652, 2188, 1826, 1836,\n2606, 1843, 2143, 1784, 1712, 1786, 2148, 2122, 1960, 629, 2169, 2283,\n2407, 2061, 1793, 1365, 1427, 1518, 1524, 2722, 1645, 1711, 2796,\n3147, 2723, 761, 2027, 2714, 2983, 2848, 2374, 2750, 926, 1728, 2766,\n2974, 2691, 2435, 2592, 1868, 2320, 2112, 1948, 2305, 2255, 2712,\n2789, 2025, 2368, 2607, 2584, 2554, 2434, 1984, 1921, NA, NA, NA, NA,\nNA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA,\nNA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA,\nNA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA, NA,\n273, 378, 293, 330, 243, 219, 209, 191, 241, 181, 141, 210, 173, 313,\n300, 334, 254, 284, 270, 300, 253, 300, 194, 264, 313, 285, 264, 306,\n247, 245, 302,